docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:694:**Launch default:** the Snapshot is the single dominant CTA on every baseline variant. Every placement that offers or describes it must carry adjacent wording that it is preliminary guidance only—not a compliance assessment, compliance certification, medical assessment or diagnosis. If the format cannot carry that caveat, the format must not mention the Snapshot.
